    Syzbot reported a KMSAN uninit-value issue in ovl_fill_real.
    
    This iusse's call chain is:
    __do_sys_getdents64()
        -> iterate_dir()
            ...
                -> ext4_readdir()
                    -> fscrypt_fname_alloc_buffer() // alloc
                    -> fscrypt_fname_disk_to_usr // write without tail '\0'
                    -> dir_emit()
                        -> ovl_fill_real() // read by strcmp()
    
